OL,3,GNEWSADrought could continue into 2027,
OL,4,Asays water firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the biggest water companies in
OL,7,FEngland has warned that drought
OL,8,Fconditions could continue into 2027.
OL,10,FAnglian Water, which supplies services
OL,11,Fto around seven million customers
OL,12,Facross the East of England, said this
OL,13,Fyear's back-to-back heatwaves had been
OL,14,Fexacerbated by a "severe" lack of rain.
OL,16,FLevels at its Grafham Water reservoir
OL,17,Fin Cambridgeshire stand at 60% of full
OL,18,Fcapacity, almost 30% lower than where
OL,19,Fthey should be.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
