OL,3,GNEWSADrought could continue into 2027,
OL,4,Asays water firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Tuplin, water resources manager
OL,7,Fat Anglian Water, explained the
OL,8,Fsituation had been made worse by low
OL,9,Fgroundwater and river levels.
